  If you use this software, please cite the archived release below.
  Please also cite the associated Part I thesis listed under references
  when discussing the research.
type: software

title: >-
  Machine Learning for Credit Risk Modeling: A Comparative Study of
  Traditional & Explainable AI Approaches - Part I
